{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "期门为肝募，胸胁苦满、胁痛、肝痛可针；针后圈穴嘱自灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr14", "zangfu.gan"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c01", "evidence_quote": "进取穴本来就是肝的目穴", "seg_from": 4, "seg_to": 8, "start_s": 10.95, "end_s": 29.37, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=10s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 10.95, "end_s": 29.37}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "奇门/进取=期门；目穴=募穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "外邪先伤络，再传经、腑；经络总根于肾。络穴不论虚实皆可取。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.shen", "acupoint.lu7", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c02", "evidence_quote": "手太阴的别落是列缺", "seg_from": 42, "seg_to": 128, "start_s": 178.77, "end_s": 614.49, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=178s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 178.77, "end_s": 614.49}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "十五络：十二经络穴加任脉络鸠尾、督脉络长强、脾之大络大包。", "entity_ids": ["concept.luo_xue", "acupoint.cv15", "acupoint.gv1", "acupoint.sp21"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c02", "evidence_quote": "这就是我们的十五络", "seg_from": 95, "seg_to": 99, "start_s": 435.01, "end_s": 467.855, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=435s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 435.01, "end_s": 467.86}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "九尾=鸠尾", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "内关为心包络穴，主心痛胸痛；丰隆为胃络，飞扬为膀胱络。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.pc6", "acupoint.st40", "acupoint.bl58"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c03", "evidence_quote": "厥阴的别落是内关内关穴", "seg_from": 141, "seg_to": 151, "start_s": 668.59, "end_s": 722.345, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=668s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 668.59, "end_s": 722.35}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "公孙为脾经络穴、主冲脉；肠痛腹痛恶心胃痛等胃肠症皆可用。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp4", "meridian.tv"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c03", "evidence_quote": "通通可以用公孙穴", "seg_from": 152, "seg_to": 152, "start_s": 724.71, "end_s": 735.615, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=724s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 724.71, "end_s": 735.62}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-056.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-056", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "带脉由足临泣所主；带脉病可取足临泣。冲脉公孙、督脉后溪、任脉列缺。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb41", "meridian.bv"], "chapter_id": "zj-056.c04", "evidence_quote": "灵气在管脚的灵气穴", "seg_from": 273, "seg_to": 279, "start_s": 1494.259, "end_s": 1536.044, "citation": {"youtube_id": "pnhGt1678cY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pnhGt1678cY&t=1494s", "series": "zj", "episode": 56, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 56", "start_s": 1494.26, "end_s": 1536.04}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "灵气=足临泣", "source": "llm_read"}
